To":{"text":"誰か俺を教室まで運んでくれ","sender":"them","senderName":""},"translation":"自作自受。你就那样滚过去不就好了？","roundId":"group_round_1781845231944_wix03xt","userId":"uid_1781767816119_d030zi4e1","characterId":"group_1781833631535","_id":1526},{"id":1781851610647,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"9ab1eb1a-2865-4e97-95bd-6479a23a4452","senderName":"Yaoyorozu Momo","text":"皆様、消化を助けるお茶を淹れましたわ。共有スペースに置いておきますわね。","timestamp":"2026-06-19T05:01:11.317Z","translation":"各位，我泡了有助于消化的茶。就放在公共休息区了哦。","roundId":"group_round_1781845231944_wix03xt","userId":"uid_1781767816119_d030zi4e1","characterId":"group_1781833631535","_id":1527},{"id":1781851610648,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"83065e83-845f-4b68-bfba-0620a129545f","senderName":"Minoro Mineta","text":"八百万の淹れたお茶……ゴクリ……行くぜえええ！！","timestamp":"2026-06-19T05:01:13.000Z","translation":"八百万亲手泡的茶……咕嘟……我来啦啊啊啊！！","roundId":"group_round_1781845231944_wix03xt","userId":"uid_1781767816119_d030zi4e1","characterId":"group_1781833631535","_id":1528},{"id":1781851610649,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"5a07ee17-2a3f-409d-b4ca-56d1bebef16d","senderName":"Asui Tsuyu","text":"峰田ちゃん、下心が顔に出すぎてるわよ。ケロ。","timestamp":"2026-06-19T05:01:15.718Z","translation":"小峰田，你的企图心都写在脸上了哦。唔。","roundId":"group_round_1781845231944_wix03xt","userId":"uid_1781767816119_d030zi4e1","characterId":"group_1781833631535","_id":1529},{"id":1781851610650,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"cc728269-b6d4-43cf-8852-4aab5763bac6","senderName":"Shinso Hitoshi","text":"茶を飲む元気があるなら早く行けよ。うるさい。","timestamp":"2026-06-19T05:01:20.654Z","translation":"有喝茶的力气就赶紧过去。吵死了。","roundId":"group_round_1781845231944_wix03xt","userId":"uid_1781767816119_d030zi4e1","characterId":"group_1781833631535","_id":1530},{"id":1781851610651,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"b24a227a-1e5d-43cb-8d8a-d28e81c0195c","senderName":"Mina Ashido","text":"表情包：laughing_hard","timestamp":"2026-06-19T05:01:21.172Z","roundId":"group_round_1781845231944_wix03xt","userId":"uid_1781767816119_d030zi4e1","characterId":"group_1781833631535","_id":1531,